/*!
\page page_stfgthit StFgtHit

\brief One-dimensional strip cluster (hit) on a single FGT readout layer.

\section fgthit_overview Overview

StFgtHit is a 1D cluster on one strip layer of the **Forward GEM Tracker (FGT)**.
Each FGT disc quadrant has two strip orientations: R-strips (measure radius r) and
P-strips (measure azimuthal angle φ).  A hit records the position along one of these
axes, the total cluster charge, Landau-fit parameters, and a transient strip weight map.

**Detector**: Forward GEM Tracker (FGT)  
**Stage**: Strip clustering → 1D hit position reconstruction

\section fgthit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StHit → StFgtHit
\endcode

Stored in the FGT hit container within \c StFgtCollection.

\section fgthit_layer Layer Convention

| \c getLayer() | Coordinate measured |
|---------------|---------------------|
| 'R' | Radial position r (cm) |
| 'P' | Azimuthal angle φ (rad) |

\section fgthit_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c Int_t | \c mKey | Unique cluster ID |
| \c Float_t | \c mR, \c mErrR | Radial position and uncertainty (cm) |
| \c Float_t | \c mPhi, \c mErrPhi | Azimuthal position and uncertainty (rad) |
| \c Int_t | \c mCentralStripGeoId | GeoId of the central (peak) strip |
| \c Float_t | \c mChargeUncert | Cluster charge uncertainty |
| \c Short_t | \c mMaxAdc | Peak ADC across strips and time bins |
| \c Float_t | \c mLandauNorm/Mpv/Sigma/Chi2 | Landau fit parameters |
| \c Int_t | \c mNstrip | Number of contributing strips |
| \c Int_t | \c mMaxTimeBin | Time bin of peak ADC |
| \c Int_t | \c mSeedType | Cluster seed type (\c kFgtSeedType*) |
| \c Float_t | \c mEvenOddChargeAsy | Even/odd strip charge asymmetry |
| \c stripWeightMap_t | \c mStripWeightMap | Transient strip→weight map (not persisted) |

\section fgthit_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c getKey() | Unique cluster ID |
| \c getDisc() | FGT disc index (0–5) |
| \c getQuad() | Quadrant index (0–3) |
| \c getLayer() | Strip layer ('R' or 'P') |
| \c getPositionR() | Radial position (cm) |
| \c getPositionPhi() | Azimuthal position (rad) |
| \c getErrorR(), \c getErrorPhi() | Position uncertainties |
| \c charge() | Total cluster charge (inherited from StHit) |
| \c getNstrip() | Number of strips in the cluster |
| \c getSeedType() | Cluster seed classification |

\section fgthit_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
const StFgtHit* hit = hitColl->hit(ih);
char layer = hit->getLayer();   // 'R' or 'P'
if (layer == 'R') {
    float r = hit->getPositionR(); // radial position (cm)
} else {
    float phi = hit->getPositionPhi(); // azimuthal angle (rad)
}
int nStr = hit->getNstrip();
float charge = hit->charge();
\endcode

\see StFgtStrip, StFgtPoint, StFgtCollection
*/
